@startuml
title Sabirzhanov Emil - implemented Bridge and Decorator
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
abstract class Graphic <<Bridge Abstraction / Decorator Component>> {
  # renderer: Renderer
  + draw(bounds: Rect)
  + setRenderer(renderer: Renderer)
}
class SpriteGraphic <<Refined Abstraction / Concrete Component>> {
  - spriteId: SpriteId
  + draw(bounds: Rect)
}
class RectangleGraphic <<Refined Abstraction / Concrete Component>> {
  - color: Rgba
  + draw(bounds: Rect)
}
interface Renderer <<Bridge Implementor>> {
  + drawSprite(id: SpriteId, bounds: Rect)
  + drawRectangle(bounds: Rect, color: Rgba)
  + drawOutline(bounds: Rect, color: Rgba)
  + drawText(text: String, position: Vec2, color: Rgba)
}
interface FrameRenderer {
  + beginFrame(graphics: Graphics2D, width: int, height: int)
  + endFrame()
}
abstract class AbstractFrameRenderer
class FilledRenderer <<Concrete Implementor>>
class WireframeRenderer <<Concrete Implementor>>
abstract class GraphicDecorator <<Base Decorator>> {
  # wrapped: Graphic
  + draw(bounds: Rect)
  + setRenderer(renderer: Renderer)
}
class OutlineDecorator <<Concrete Decorator>>
class HealthBarDecorator <<Concrete Decorator>>
class DecorationSettings <<immutable record>>
class GraphicLayers {
  + {static} compose(base: Graphic, health: HealthView, outline: boolean, healthBar: boolean, settings: DecorationSettings): Graphic
}
interface HealthView {
  + currentHealth(): int
  + maxHealth(): int
}
Graphic <|-- SpriteGraphic
Graphic <|-- RectangleGraphic
Graphic o--> Renderer : delegates drawing
Renderer <|-- FrameRenderer
FrameRenderer <|.. AbstractFrameRenderer
AbstractFrameRenderer <|-- FilledRenderer
AbstractFrameRenderer <|-- WireframeRenderer
Graphic <|-- GraphicDecorator
GraphicDecorator *--> Graphic : wrapped
GraphicDecorator <|-- OutlineDecorator
GraphicDecorator <|-- HealthBarDecorator
HealthBarDecorator --> HealthView : read only
OutlineDecorator --> DecorationSettings
HealthBarDecorator --> DecorationSettings
GraphicLayers ..> OutlineDecorator : optional first layer
GraphicLayers ..> HealthBarDecorator : optional outer layer
note bottom of GraphicDecorator
draw delegates to wrapped, then adds its layer.
setRenderer propagates into wrapped.
GraphicLayers rebuilds from an undecorated base.
Showcase verifies base and decorated views.
Game entity integration remains planned.
end note
note bottom of FrameRenderer
Both implementations draw real frames through Java2D.
Two visual styles, one graphics backend.
end note
@enduml
